&lt;p&gt;From: G. Lench, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Bremerton, Washington on Jan 18&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Received your letter OK but don’t know. I will give you the benefit of the doubt. Who can argue a woman out of anything. Ha. Ha.&lt;br&gt;
G. Lench&lt;br&gt;
Will ans. soon&lt;/p&gt;</description>
